/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
778 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 469 0 R
/E (On the other hand, Wi-Fi 6 is a High-Efficiency Wi-Fi network that allows for seamless internet when one connects. Internet connectivity at home and offices increased significantly with the introduction of fibre-optics being used for internet connections. These cables become more resistance to interference, decreasing lag. Fibre has also been able to provide higher bandwidth than alternatives such as ADSL. However, Wi-Fi 6 is able to process the fibre connection by providing the internet connection. Like 5G technology, Huawei is also a leader in Wi-Fi 6 devices. These Wi- Fi 6 devices offered by the likes of Huawei and TP-Link support up to four times higher network bandwidth than previous WiFi )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
