/P 470 0 R
/E (The graphic processing unit \(GPU\) is one of the most critical computer technologies that will power the Metaverse. Both developers and end users require a graphical processing unit for enhancing the graphics and video rendering. CPUs have a few cores while GPUs have many. Also, while CPUs do computations in serial form, GPUs do them in parallel. In simple terms, GPUs provide that extra bit of muscle that can help a program do more complex computations. This video by IBM explains GPUs and how they differ from CPUs. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
787 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
