/P 470 0 R
/E (Initially, the gaming industry was the most important customer of graphic processing units, but now they are becoming increasingly used in other computationally intensive areas such as Artificial Intelligence. McKinsey & Company researched some of the use cases of GPUs. Many different industries have use cases for GPUs. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
