/T (These GPUs are not just a requirement in the video gaming industry. In the Metaverse, GPUs will be required in finance, health care, machine learning, data science etc. Crypto mining has become popular too and is sped up by using GPUs. An alternative to having a physical silicon-based microprocessor is to have Cloud GPU providers. Almost all cloud services companies now provide this service, including Google Cloud and AWS. )
